If you have turned colors off in your options file because your
terminal does not display them Sporkhack will know better than that
and still present the startup screen in color so you can not see how
to move on to the next step.

The fix is to copy and paste the entire screen to a text editor that
strips text colors and there you will discover the magic key to
actually play the game.

